    "text": "By Press Release ,\n7 hours ago YOUNGSVILLE, Pa. – Halgren-Wilcox American Legion Auxiliary Unit 658 in Youngsville has announced its scholarship recipients for the 2026 graduating class. This year, two local seniors from the former Youngsville High School attendance area were selected to receive scholarships: Rachael Lucks and Macenzie Jenkins. In addition to the scholarships,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
